                                                                                
 Usage: opentide deploy [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...                             
                                                                                
 Deploy rules to platform tenants                                               
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --platform                                   PLATFORM  Detection platform:   │
│                                                        sentinel, splunk,     │
│                                                        crowdstrike,          │
│                                                        defender_for_endpoin… │
│                                                        sentinel_one,         │
│                                                        carbon_black_cloud,   │
│                                                        harfanglab, elastic,  │
│                                                        sysdig                │
│ --strategy                                   <str>     Status strategy this  │
│                                                        run deploys           │
│                                                        (repeatable).         │
│                                                        PREVIEW: rules whose  │
│                                                        status maps to        │
│                                                        PREVIEW or UNIVERSAL. │
│                                                        RELEASE: rules whose  │
│                                                        status maps to        │
│                                                        RELEASE or UNIVERSAL, │
│                                                        and disables or       │
│                                                        deletes those mapping │
│                                                        to DISABLEMENT or     │
│                                                        DELETION. Each rule   │
│                                                        goes to the tenants   │
│                                                        whose 'strategies'    │
│                                                        accept the run's      │
│                                                        strategy. Status      │
│                                                        names such as STAGING │
│                                                        or PRODUCTION are not │
│                                                        strategies            │
│ --all                                                  Read every rule file, │
│                                                        not only those the    │
│                                                        run changed (the pull │
│                                                        or merge request, the │
│                                                        push, or outside CI   │
│                                                        the last commit)      │
│ --uuid                                       <str>     Read this rule        │
│                                                        (metadata.uuid)       │
│                                                        instead of the        │
│                                                        changed ones          │
│                                                        (repeatable). Cannot  │
│                                                        be combined with      │
│                                                        --all                 │
│ --file                                       <str>     Read this rule file,  │
│                                                        matched as by         │
│                                                        'opentide validate    │
│                                                        --file', instead of   │
│                                                        the changed ones      │
│                                                        (repeatable). Cannot  │
│                                                        be combined with      │
│                                                        --all                 │
│ --wide                                                 Deploy the rule files │
│                                                        read whatever their   │
│                                                        status strategy,      │
│                                                        INERT included        │
│ --dry-run                                              Print the plan and    │
│                                                        compile each rule;    │
│                                                        send nothing          │
│ --keep-deprecated       --drop-deprecated              Include rules whose   │
│                                                        status maps to        │
│                                                        DISABLEMENT or        │
│                                                        DELETION, so a        │
│                                                        RELEASE run disables  │
│                                                        or deletes them.      │
│                                                        Default: on, off with │
│                                                        --all                 │
│ --skip-promotion                                       Skip the status       │
│                                                        promotion of a        │
│                                                        RELEASE run on a push │
│ --skip-unconfigured                                    Exit 0 when every     │
│                                                        platform with rules   │
│                                                        to deploy has no      │
│                                                        [[tenants]] block     │
│ --persist-state-ext…                                   Allow Defender,       │
│                                                        SentinelOne and       │
│                                                        CrowdStrike creates   │
│                                                        in a CI run other     │
│                                                        than a RELEASE run on │
│                                                        a push; this pipeline │
│                                                        must commit           │
│                                                        .opentide/states/dep… │
│                                                        itself                │
│ --help                                                 Show this message and │
│                                                        exit.                 │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭─ Commands ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ migrate-state  Move vendor ids from rules into deployment state              │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

 Examples
   $ opentide deploy --strategy PREVIEW --all --dry-run
   $ opentide deploy --strategy RELEASE
